ed1ff440626556e22e4.jpg","strMarketHash":"1364780-SF6 Marisa","nOwned":0}]}}],["achievements",{"version":2,"data":{"vecHighlight":[],"vecUnachieved":[{"strID":"ACHIEVEMENT_43","strName":"请赐教","strDescription":"想了解街头格斗的基础？不好意思，我现在没心思收徒……你去“教学”看看吧。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1364780/8ddac428e518864687c3cc158d4a45962dd97c55.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":94.69999694824219,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACHIEVEMENT_27","strName":"杰米哥的称号","strDescription":"你有没有大显身手，获得过一个“称号”啊？嗯？我？我杰米 · 肖的大名本身就是个称号，不是吗？哈哈哈！","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1364780/1168dfdea4b8024cc6b2b80e07aea91c3a74c82e.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":91.5,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACHIEVEMENT_41","strName":"雏鸟学飞","strDescription":"你知道吗？空中时速200公里的燕子……也是从一只雏鸟练出来的。你也要在“训练模式”中多多练习。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1364780/85e5465c99b544756a2f9b5ea60ee735317ce0ab.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":83.30000305175781,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACHIEVEMENT_1","strName":"长点脸再来","strDescription":"你这家伙怎么回事……没脸见人吗？去“创建虚拟形象”再来吧。让我看看你能不能长点脸！","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1364780/6d16128522dfe28c9f3cf8481ef8f2bb7e87312c.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":83,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACHIEVEMENT_2","strName":"这里就是格斗中心？","strDescription":"欢迎来到“格斗中心”。不管你的目的是什么，尽情享受吧。因为这里就是享乐之处。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1364780/fa5c374d64de2ca412030af77861b5d789347703.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":66.4000015258789,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACHIEVEMENT_42","strName":"格斗手秘传？","strDescription":"哦！“角色指南”真是好东西啊！会教你格斗手们的招式和格斗方式。你去看看怎么样？啊，也会教你武神流哦。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1364780/3543b8872f0d6ec2ae126b6cb352781148ba4495.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":53.29999923706055,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACHIEVEMENT_38","strName":"第100场芭蕾凌空跃","strDescription":"在斗技战场进行100场“线上赛”。很难做到吗？但这是走向世界的必经之路。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1364780/736981ebab1c868adc4c24b69ff79ad49f6f6d9d.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":45,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACHIEVEMENT_22","strName":"众望所归","strDescription":"哼！在助威声中格斗，对摔跤手来说是很光荣的！你也去热斗一场，获得大家的助威吧！“喝彩”就是助威的证明，你要得到它哟！","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1364780/f0f645c368edc00c4af266b34c75eed26b65a608.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":42,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACHIEVEMENT_39","strName":"格斗手的诗篇","strDescription":"baby！去通关斗技战场的一个“街机”游戏吧。这样你就能听到了吧？格斗手们的story！","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1364780/cf49371a4253cc436b7a50cbd145cb5eefd7e306.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":37.5,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACHIEVEMENT_29","strName":"时尚弄潮儿","strDescription":"不同的服饰可以展现不同的自我。如果不分时间场合总是同一副打扮，那和动物有什么区别？快在设备里“变更”“装备”吧。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1364780/b8d4ee0fb8ec12de6be3960b93396d2c308e4652.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":36.29999923706055,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACHIEVEMENT_28","strName":"独行不如众乐","strDescription":"独行并不等于强大哦。狼无论独行，还是成群都很强大。我觉得交“朋友”也很不错。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1364780/6e65d3e4a0b7a3259db2b4751efe497ca261a766.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":35.79999923706055,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACHIEVEMENT_37","strName":"敢来找麻烦，教训一顿！","strDescription":"你走在街上的时候，不是会有人来找麻烦吗？那种人就该用“师父动作”狠狠地教训一顿！你试试吧，感觉很不错的。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1364780/b3b7a085bc66bc2a3c9778bcd2f5b6d088e647d6.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":34.900001525878906,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0}],"vecAchievedHidden":[],"nTotal":43,"nAchieved":0}}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"CAPCOM Co., Ltd.","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/developer/capcom"}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"CAPCOM Co., Ltd.","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/capcom"}],"rgFranchises":[{"strName":"Street Fighter","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/curator/34053640"}]}}]]